{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/demo_gif-ezgif.com-overlay.gif?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Greenwood Defense is a straightforward 2D strategy game where your main goal is simple: keep your captain safe from endless waves of frog enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You'll deploy your units and then make them stronger by leveling them up. Each of the <strong>15+ unique units</strong> has four levels and gets new tricks as they grow. Mix and match their special abilities with the <strong>16 permanent upgrades</strong> you can unlock, plus <strong>4 powerful special abilities</strong> you can use during battles. There are tons of ways to play!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/cooltext484869547587964.png?t=1750454429\" /></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/defend2-ezgif.com-overlay__1_.gif?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/cooltext484869513760282.png?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/shopgif3-ezgif.com-overlay.gif?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/level_trunk_1_to_4.gif?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/cooltext484869564256242.png?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/extras/earngold-ezgif.com-overlay.gif?t=1750454429\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Can you push through all <strong>100 challenging stages</strong>? You'll face new kinds of frogs every five stages, and even two massive super bosses that'll really test your skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc14\u00a0<strong>15+ Unique Units:</strong> Each unit levels up four times and gets its own special ability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2b06\ufe0f <strong>16 Permanent Upgrades:</strong> Boost your defense in different ways that stick around.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2728 <strong>4 Special Battle Abilities:</strong> Use these to turn the tide when things get tough. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\uddfa\ufe0f <strong>100 Stages:</strong> New enemies pop up every five stages, keeping things fresh. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc51 <strong>2 Super Bosses:</strong> Big, tough enemies to really challenge your strategy. </p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2923470?t=1750454429","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2923470/8686fa52fbc0408b3db05c691689ba55fd6bc5a9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750454429","capsule_image":"https:/